{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
To start resolving accounts through STNS:

1. Write %%PREFIX%%/etc/stns/client/stns.conf.  A sample has been installed
   there for you, and %%PREFIX%%/share/examples/nss_stns/stns.conf is the
   annotated original.

2. Add stns to /etc/nsswitch.conf, after files so that local accounts always
   win and the machine stays usable if the API is unreachable:

	passwd: files stns
	group:  files stns

A symbolic link to the module has been created in /usr/lib.  libc loads name
service modules by bare name, and a set-user-ID program such as su(1) searches
only /lib and /usr/lib, so without it privileged programs would silently fail
to resolve STNS accounts.
EOM
}
]
